DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3709::$$$message_0027_0000_0000$$$::I head to Rider's room with a small paperback in hand.[lr]::
3710::$$$message_0027_0000_0001$$$::I finished reading this book I borrowed from her, so I'm going to return it and ask for something new.[lr]::
3711::$$$message_0027_0000_0002$$$::"Rider, I'm coming in."::
3712::$$$message_0027_0001_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=600]......"[lr]::
3713::$$$message_0027_0001_0001$$$::What's going on?[lr]::
3714::$$$message_0027_0001_0002$$$::Tohsaka is closely examining Rider's hair.[lr]::
3715::$$$message_0027_0001_0003$$$::Rider looks a tad flustered about it.[lr]::
3716::$$$message_0027_0001_0004$$$::The room also has a Secret Garden-esque atmosphere, for some reason.::
3717::$$$message_0027_0002_0000$$$::"Ah, Emiya. What's up? You're just standing there in the doorway."[lr]::
3718::$$$message_0027_0002_0001$$$::"...Oh, I just came to return this book...... What are you doing?"[lr]::
3719::$$$message_0027_0002_0002$$$::My voice comes out like a robot, disconnected from my disorganized thoughts.::
3720::$$$message_0027_0003_0000$$$::"Can't you tell? Rider's hair is pretty, so I just couldn't help myself."[lr]::
3721::$$$message_0027_0003_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
3722::$$$message_0027_0003_0002$$$::Yes...and what can't you help doing?::
3723::$$$message_0027_0004_0000$$$::"You brought the book back, Shirou?[lr]::
3724::$$$message_0027_0004_0001$$$::Please leave it over there. [cacheimage storage=凛私服05b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05b(中) textoff=0]I'll put it away soon."[lr]::
3725::$$$message_0027_0004_0002$$$::"R-right. Um Rider. Does Tohsaka have dirt on you, or something?"[lr]::
3726::$$$message_0027_0004_0003$$$::There's something subtly wrong with this picture, or maybe the viewer is just nervous.[lr]::
3727::$$$message_0027_0004_0004$$$::Rider doesn't exactly seem like a willing participant, either.::
3728::$$$message_0027_0005_0000$$$::"It isn't so shocking as that.[lr]::
3729::$$$message_0027_0005_0001$$$::Rin said she wanted to look at my hair, so I'm just letting her brush it out."[lr]::
3730::$$$message_0027_0005_0002$$$::"O-oh. I'm jeal[line len=2]I mean, I'm just thinking it's unusual to see someone else touching your hair.[lr]::
3731::$$$message_0027_0005_0003$$$::What about her hair makes you so curious, Tohsaka?"::
3732::$$$message_0027_0006_0000$$$::Does it have something to do with magecraft?[lr]::
3733::$$$message_0027_0006_0001$$$::Women's hair is supposed to have a lot of magical energy in it, so maybe she's trying out something she learned in London.::
3734::$$$message_0027_0007_0000$$$::"What? Well, look."[lr]::
3735::$$$message_0027_0007_0001$$$::She holds up a handful of hair, then another handful.[lr]::
3736::$$$message_0027_0007_0002$$$::She's acting completely serious.[lr]::
3737::$$$message_0027_0007_0003$$$::Examining a precious gem like only Rin Tohsaka would, but...::
3738::$$$message_0027_0008_0000$$$::"Why...doesn't she have any split ends?"[lr]::
3739::$$$message_0027_0008_0001$$$::"...[shock vmax=30 time=1000 count=-3]"[lr]::
3740::$$$message_0027_0008_0002$$$::Seriously, what the heck are these two doing?::
3741::$$$message_0027_0009_0000$$$::"Wow. You must be really bored."[lr]::
3742::$$$message_0027_0009_0001$$$::"W-well, look how pretty her hair stays all day, even though it's this long. It would make any woman curious."[lr]::
3743::$$$message_0027_0009_0002$$$::"They say that at the beauty salon from time to time. That it's absurd I have no split ends with hair this long.[lr]::
3744::$$$message_0027_0009_0003$$$::It seems that hair will always be a popular topic among women."::
3745::$$$message_0027_0010_0000$$$::Rider smiles quietly and gently.[lr]::
3746::$$$message_0027_0010_0001$$$::Split ends... I can't quite relate, but it does sound like a serious problem for girls.[lr]::
3747::$$$message_0027_0010_0002$$$::I hear that hair gets like that when it's damaged, and that it's a perpetual source of worry for long-haired girls.::
3748::$$$message_0027_0011_0000$$$::"...Should we look for your split ends next, Rin?"[lr]::
3749::$$$message_0027_0011_0001$$$::"Huh? W-we don't have to do that."[lr]::
3750::$$$message_0027_0011_0002$$$::Tohsaka recoils at Rider's suggestion.::
3751::$$$message_0027_0012_0000$$$::"You go to quite some lengths to treat your black hair, don't you? I'm quite envious of its silken texture."[lr]::
3752::$$$message_0027_0012_0001$$$::"Oh... Y-you're making me blush..."::
3753::$$$message_0027_0013_0000$$$::Rider takes a lock of Tohsaka's hair in her hand.[lr]::
3754::$$$message_0027_0013_0001$$$::...The Secret Garden gauge keeps rising.[lr]::
3755::$$$message_0027_0013_0002$$$::I've been trying not to say anything stupid, but this scene is starting to make me have inappropriate thoughts.::
3756::$$$message_0027_0014_0000$$$::"Oh look, Rider. Someone's staring at us."[lr]::
3757::$$$message_0027_0014_0001$$$::"Uh."[lr]::
3758::$$$message_0027_0014_0002$$$::Oh crap, I was spellbound.[lr]::
3759::$$$message_0027_0014_0003$$$::I shake my head and back away from them.::
3760::$$$message_0027_0015_0000$$$::"...You don't seem like you have any split ends, Shirou."[lr]::
3761::$$$message_0027_0015_0001$$$::"Huh? I mean, I might, but I've never really thought about it."[lr]::
3762::$$$message_0027_0015_0002$$$::"It's too bad. If your hair was a little longer, it would have been your turn next."[lr]::
3763::$$$message_0027_0015_0003$$$::Rider smiles smugly.[lr]::
3764::$$$message_0027_0015_0004$$$::...I'm just realizing this now, but these two might be the most mean-spirited people in this house.::
3765::$$$message_0027_0016_0000$$$::"Let's change the subject. Actually, you can keep talking about this, but do it with someone else."[lr]::
3766::$$$message_0027_0016_0001$$$::I activate my defenses.[lr]::
3767::$$$message_0027_0016_0002$$$::At this rate, I'm going to turn into their plaything.::
3768::$$$message_0027_0017_0000$$$::"Someone else...yes.[lr]::
3769::$$$message_0027_0017_0001$$$::There is a man in the area who I'm curious about."[lr]::
3770::$$$message_0027_0017_0002$$$::"Who? I don't think we know any men with long hair."::
3771::$$$message_0027_0018_0000$$$::"Sasaki Kojirou, the Assassin."[lr]::
3772::$$$message_0027_0018_0001$$$::"Ahh."[lr]::
3773::$$$message_0027_0018_0002$$$::That makes perfect sense. Even I think he has magnificent hair.::
3774::$$$message_0027_0019_0000$$$::"Wait. You know how much free time he has. It wouldn't surprise me if he spent the whole day taking care of his split ends."[lr]::
3775::$$$message_0027_0019_0001$$$::"But Rin.[lr]::
3776::$$$message_0027_0019_0002$$$::He's a Servant. I doubt he has any."::
3777::$$$message_0027_0020_0000$$$::"Argh... That would be humiliating to hear...[cacheimage storage=凛私服09a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服09a(中) time=300 textoff=0] If I have to hear him laugh, 'worried about your split ends? Hahaha, very good. You're a maiden as long as you worry about your appearance, and your maidenly beauty will only grow,' I'll pass out from shock."::
3778::$$$message_0027_0021_0000$$$::"That does sound like something he would say. He's a man who pursues beauty."[lr]::
3779::$$$message_0027_0021_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
3780::$$$message_0027_0021_0002$$$::That example sounded so specific it might well have been something he said already.::
3781::$$$message_0027_0022_0000$$$::...Still, I'd like to ask him sometime, too.[lr]::
3782::$$$message_0027_0022_0001$$$::Not about split ends, but about what he does to take care of his battle coat.::
3783::$$$message_0027_0023_0000$$$::...I'd better not.[lr]::
3784::$$$message_0027_0023_0001$$$::He'd probably just slice me from shoulder to hip.::
3785::$$$message_0027_0024_0000$$$::"Let's not think about a man's split ends. My heart can only take so much."[lr]::
3786::$$$message_0027_0024_0001$$$::"You and Sakura both seem to struggle with your hair."::
3787::$$$message_0027_0025_0000$$$::"Well, I do what I can not to come off as a slob. You should help Sakura out, too.[lr]::
3788::$$$message_0027_0025_0001$$$::With a little polish, she'll shine even brighter."[lr]::
3789::$$$message_0027_0025_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
3790::$$$message_0027_0025_0003$$$::Is that sisterly kindness, or encouragement for a rival?::
3791::$$$message_0027_0026_0000$$$::"Yes, if you're willing to compete with a handicap, then we'll take up your challenge."[lr]::
3792::$$$message_0027_0026_0001$$$::"In the chest area I'm the one with a handicap...[cacheimage storage=凛私服06a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服06a(中) pos=lc time=300 textoff=0][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-3] Hey, this is no laughing matter!"[lr]::
3793::$$$message_0027_0026_0002$$$::"I-I didn't even do anything!"::
903714::$$$message_9027_0001_0002$$$::Tohsaka is closely examining Rider's hair. Rider looks a tad flustered about it.::
�